WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.367
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.767
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:05.434
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:06.767
The White House said yesterday

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:08.934
that it supports
a new bipartisan bill

00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:11.767
that would give President Biden
the power to ban TikTok.

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:14.801
Of course, Biden could end
TikTok at any time

00:00:14.801 --> 00:00:16.667
simply by making an account.

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:18.601
Ugh, okay.

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:20.601
This jumped the shark.

00:00:20.601 --> 00:00:21.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:23.534
Capitol Police Chief
Thomas Manger

00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:25.200
issued a statement yesterday

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.868
criticizing Fox host
Tucker Carlson's release

00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:30.534
of security footage
from the January 6th attack

00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:33.801
and said Carlson made "offensive
and misleading conclusions."

00:00:33.801 --> 00:00:35.801
Of course,
that's just what it says

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:38.300
when you turn on
his closed captioning.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:43.300
According to newly released
legal documents,

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.467
Fox News host Tucker Carlson
told colleagues

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:48.534
after the 2020 election,
"We are very, very close

00:00:48.534 --> 00:00:50.534
to being able to ignore Trump
most nights.

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:53.868
I truly can't wait.
I hate him passionately."

00:00:53.868 --> 00:00:55.701
Wait, wait, are you telling me

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:58.033
Tucker Carlson
is secretly sane?

00:00:58.033 --> 00:01:00.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.767 --> 00:01:03.400
I would feel so betrayed
if I was a Fox viewer.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:05.234
This is like
if you joined a cult,

00:01:05.234 --> 00:01:07.200
sold all your belongings,
shaved your head,

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.934
moved to the desert,
and then it turns out

00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:10.267
the cult leader is just, like...

00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:11.767
a Methodist.

00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:14.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.934
Voters in Oklahoma
rejected a measure yesterday

00:01:16.934 --> 00:01:19.267
to legalize the recreational use
of marijuana.

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:23.434
Apparently, time already moves
slowly enough in Oklahoma.

00:01:23.434 --> 00:01:25.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.033
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:29.367
reportedly sent a letter
to President Biden

00:01:29.367 --> 00:01:32.534
requesting that he allow
tennis star Novak Djokovic

00:01:32.534 --> 00:01:34.868
to enter the country to play
in the Miami Open tournament.

00:01:34.868 --> 00:01:35.934
That story again --

00:01:35.934 --> 00:01:37.934
Ron DeSantis begs Biden

00:01:37.934 --> 00:01:39.767
to open the border.

00:01:39.767 --> 00:01:41.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:44.234
After Senator Bernie Sanders
threatened to subpoena him,

00:01:44.234 --> 00:01:46.934
Starbucks CEO Howard Schultz
has agreed to testify

00:01:46.934 --> 00:01:49.267
before the Senate's
Health, Education, Labor

00:01:49.267 --> 00:01:50.467
and Pensions Committee.

00:01:50.467 --> 00:01:52.868
And much like a black coffee
from Starbucks,

00:01:52.868 --> 00:01:54.200
this has been brewing

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:55.868
for a very long time.

00:01:55.868 --> 00:01:57.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:01.634
[ Laughter continues ]

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:03.300
We talk -- you know,
I'll be honest with you --

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:04.734
behind the scenes,
we talked a little bit.

00:02:04.734 --> 00:02:06.067
Like, "Is that joke
gonna work at all?"

00:02:06.067 --> 00:02:07.400
And it worked a little.

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.067 --> 00:02:11.067
A venti?
How do you say a little?

00:02:12.901 --> 00:02:14.400
-Tall.
-Tall.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:19.567
That coffee joke
worked a tall.

00:02:19.567 --> 00:02:21.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.901 --> 00:02:24.400
My callback didn't work a-tall.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:25.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.901 --> 00:02:27.234
You know what?
We're getting there.

00:02:27.234 --> 00:02:28.300
We're getting -- We're almost --

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:30.801
We've almost put
a button on this.

00:02:30.801 --> 00:02:33.133
Feel like I should have
gotten out a minute ago.

00:02:33.133 --> 00:02:35.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.367 --> 00:02:36.701
That's right, St--
Oh, boy.

00:02:36.701 --> 00:02:38.534
Now there's a follow-up
Starbucks joke.

00:02:38.534 --> 00:02:41.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.367 --> 00:02:45.868
Way to keep the flow going,
Meyers.

00:02:45.868 --> 00:02:48.200
That's right,
Starbucks CEO Howard Schultz

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.834
will testify
before a Senate committee

00:02:49.834 --> 00:02:52.834
as part of an investigation into
the chain's labor practices.

00:02:52.834 --> 00:02:55.267
And while he's there,
they've also got some questions

00:02:55.267 --> 00:02:57.100
about those egg bites.

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.601 --> 00:03:05.834
And finally,
Tinder recently released

00:03:05.834 --> 00:03:08.400
an Australian edition
of its dating dictionary,

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:10.400
which includes the phrase
"kitten fishing."

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:13.000
That means
"changing aspects of yourself

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.334
to appear more attractive
to others".

00:03:15.334 --> 00:03:16.734
Or, as we call that here,

00:03:16.734 --> 00:03:18.167
dating.

00:03:18.167 --> 00:03:19.167
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:19.167 --> 00:03:20.834
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:03:20.834 --> 00:03:21.968
We're off and running.

